Manifest-Version: 1.0
Bundle-Version: 6.2.0.r
X-Bundle-Update-Library: true
X-Bundle-Update-Library-Info: New 'Synchronize Stream Files' library services.\nCVTSPLF accepts spooled file numbers up to 999999.\nFixed the member filters of the iSphere Synchronize Members editor.
X-Bundle-Info: Added iSphere Synchronize Stream Files editor.\nFixed the negated masks and the masks without name of the iSphere Synchronize Members editor.\nFixed option 'Maximum depth' of the iSphere Stream File Search for RSE filters and with 'Batch resolve enabled'.\nFixed opening spooled files with workspace encoding COMPAT in RDi 9.9.\nFixed opening spooled files with spooled file numbers greater than 9999.\nChanged HTML of spooled files converted with 'Transform' to specify the character set.
X-Beta-Version: 6.2.0.r
X-Beta-Update-Library: true
X-Beta-Update-Library-Info: New 'Synchronize Stream Files' library services.\nCVTSPLF accepts spooled file numbers up to 999999.\nFixed the member filters of the iSphere Synchronize Members editor.
X-Beta-Info: Added iSphere Synchronize Stream Files editor.\nFixed the negated masks and the masks without name of the iSphere Synchronize Members editor.\nFixed option 'Maximum depth' of the iSphere Stream File Search for RSE filters and with 'Batch resolve enabled'.\nFixed opening spooled files with workspace encoding COMPAT in RDi 9.9.\nFixed opening spooled files with spooled file numbers greater than 9999.\nChanged HTML of spooled files converted with 'Transform' to specify the character set.
